      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_48xsr40v4p",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 0,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Who is doing the work, and why"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 1
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The starting team."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We are a small starting team building the scaffolding for SPIRIT — so the Front Range Commons, made of the people who live here, can carry the work going forward. Our job is to make ourselves obsolete."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_rpg0t5d45r",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "● Stewards photographed by "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "True To Essence",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "link",
                          "attrs": {
                            "href": "https://www.truetoessence.com",
                            "newTab": true
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sec_7frnxv3nke",
      "preset": "starter/stack-12@1",
      "layout": {
        "mode": "stack",
        "columns": {
          "d": [
            12
          ]
        }
      },
      "style": {
        "colorTheme": "light"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_5dvk3nwahk",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Transitional Stewards"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We are a small team at the beginning of something, and we don't have all the answers."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "SPIRIT is guided by a small team of "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Transitional Stewards",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " whose aim is to establish the Bioregional Commons that will determine its own character and trajectories through distributed, decentralized decision-making. Our explicit goal is to build something that will no longer need us so that we, too, can join the Commons as fellow commoners, with no more authority or say than anyone else. We do not pretend to have all the answers. "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "(Who does!?)",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " What we have is our commitment to this place and to each other, and a willingness to learn in public."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Our aim is for SPIRIT’s board to be comprised of highly-regarded community leaders, particularly elders and Indigenous relatives. For now, we Transitional Stewards show up with full commitment and open hands, oriented towards that ultimate transition."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "— 04.1 —"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
