      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_2y9h84v91n",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 0,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Where this is going"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Eventually, the team will not look like us."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_6nsjmz7bzf",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "In time, we hope SPIRIT's Board will be made up of "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Indigenous leaders, elders, and longtime community stewards",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " — people who actually represent who lives on the Front Range."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "For now, the six of us are the starting team. Our goal is to become regular members of the Front Range Commons, with no more authority than anyone else. "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "SPIRIT exists to serve the Commons",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", not to keep itself going."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
